/* SkillBinder prototype kit: icons.
 *
 * window.ICONS      { name: '<svg…>' } real markup from the repo (generated by
 *                   source/kit/gen_icons.py into icons.js.parts/2-generated.js; never edit that file by hand).
 *   Hugeicons (stroke = currentColor): search plus delete check close alert-circle
 *     upload-circle layers folder code-folder square-terminal loading refresh-03
 *     refresh-04 check-circle arrow-down chevron-right list-view grid-view libraries
 *     compass settings import unplug book code robot pencil-edit git-branch
 *   Agent logos: claude-code codex kimi-code-cli (full color) ·
 *     cline cursor fx pi warp windsurf (mono, fill = currentColor)
 * window.NEW_ICONS  { filter more minus undo link } hand-drawn glyphs NOT in the
 *                   retained set; always render them through newIcon().
 * icon(name, size = 16, cls = '') -> svg markup string, sized, class "sb-ic".
 *                   Unknown names log console.error and render a visible "?" box.
 * newIcon(name, size = 16) -> markup wrapped in .sb-newicon (dashed outline,
 *                   tooltip "new icon") so the user sees the glyph needs adding.
 * isColorLogo(name) -> true for logos that keep their own colors.
 */

